From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:05:18 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] sgx-carts

A SuperGrafx card wears the Super HuCard: the white HuCard of the
TurboGrafx-16 shelf at the same size, turned over, so the gold contacts
and the cut marks sit above the label and the ridges below it. Hudson's
Super HuCards carry their label the other way up from a standard
HuCard (Wikipedia, PC Engine SuperGrafx). A .sgx file gets it; a .pce
card on the shelf (Darius Plus and Darius Alpha, standard HuCards with
the PC-SG mark) keeps the plain HuCard. The label is the HuCard's
square, mirrored top to bottom.

sgx_cart.svg is the HuCard outline, sgx_cart_detail.svg the HuCard
relief flipped with the same light, lit into retro/sgx_neutral.png by
examples/retro_neutrals.rs; every other neutral regenerates byte for
byte.
---
 crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/sgx_neutral.png | Bin 0 -> 54922 bytes
 crates/slot-ui/assets/sgx_cart.svg          |   3 +
 crates/slot-ui/assets/sgx_cart_detail.svg   |  38 ++++++
 crates/slot-ui/examples/retro_neutrals.rs   |   6 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/cart.rs                  |   3 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_cart.rs            |  28 +++--
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_face.rs            |   3 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_shell.rs           |   2 +-
 crates/slot-ui/tests/render_nes_shelves.rs  |   5 +-
 crates/slot-ui/tests/retro_bitmap.rs        |   6 +
 crates/slot-ui/tests/sgx_card.rs            | 131 ++++++++++++++++++++
 11 files changed, 212 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/sgx_neutral.png
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/sgx_cart.svg
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/sgx_cart_detail.svg
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/tests/sgx_card.rs

diff --git a/crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/sgx_neutral.png b/crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/sgx_neutral.png
new file mode 100644
